---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import CallToAction from '../components/CallToAction.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
    title="Impermeabilizzazioni e protezione degli edifici | Poliurea System"
    description="Scopri le soluzioni per infiltrazioni, terrazzi, coperture e fondazioni. Raccontaci il tuo intervento e richiedi un sopralluogo."
>
    <section class="home-hero">
        <div class="hero-grid wrap">
            <div class="hero-copy">
                <p class="eyebrow inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sky-400 mb-4"><span class="eyebrow-line h-px w-6 bg-sky-400"></span> PROTEZIONE DALL’ACQUA, SENZA IMPROVVISARE</p>
                <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white leading-[1.08] mb-6">L’acqua trova<br />la strada.<br /><span class="text-sky-400">Noi la soluzione.</span></h1>
                <p class="hero-description text-base sm:text-lg text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed max-w-xl mb-8">Infiltrazioni, umidità, terrazzi e coperture: partiamo dal problema reale per individuare l’intervento più adatto al tuo edificio.</p>
                <div class="hero-actions">
                    <a class="button button-primary" href="/preventivo">Richiedi un sopralluogo <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
                    <a class="text-link" href="/metodo">Scopri il nostro metodo <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
                </div>
                <div class="hero-note mt-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-400"><span class="note-check flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-sky-500/15 border border-sky-500/30 text-sky-400 font-bold">✓</span> Un primo confronto, senza impegno</div>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-visual" aria-label="Illustrazione architettonica di un edificio protetto dall’acqua" role="img">
                <div class="visual-orbit orbit-one"></div>
                <div class="visual-orbit orbit-two"></div>
                <div class="visual-sun"></div>
                <div class="building">
                    <div class="building-roof"></div>
                    <div class="building-body">
                        <span class="building-window window-one"></span>
                        <span class="building-window window-two"></span>
                        <span class="building-window window-three"></span>
                        <span class="building-door"></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="building-foundation"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="ground-line"></div>
                <div class="water-line water-one"></div>
                <div class="water-line water-two"></div>
                <div class="visual-label"><span class="online-dot"></span> Una protezione pensata per il tuo edificio</div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-bottom wrap flex items-center justify-center gap-4 text-xs font-mono font-bold tracking-widest text-zinc-500 py-6 border-t border-zinc-800/80">
            <span>DALLE FONDAZIONI</span><i class="h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-zinc-700"></i><span>ALLE COPERTURE</span><i class="h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-zinc-700"></i><span>FINO AI DETTAGLI</span>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-block wrap py-20">
        <div class="section-heading mb-12 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-6">
            <div>
                <p class="eyebrow inline-block rounded-md border border-sky-500/25 bg-sky-500/10 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-400 mb-3">DOVE POSSIAMO INTERVENIRE</p>
                <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight">Ogni edificio ha<br /><span class="text-sky-400">il suo punto da proteggere.</span></h2>
            </div>
            <p class="text-base text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed max-w-md">Umidità e infiltrazioni hanno cause diverse. Individuare la zona interessata è il primo passo per scegliere come intervenire.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-grid">
            <a class="service-card rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900 p-7 shadow-lg shadow-black/60 transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-zinc-700 hover:bg-zinc-800/80 hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:shadow-2xl" href="/fondazioni#fondazioni">
                <span class="card-index text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-400">01 / STRUTTURE INTERRATE</span>
                <span class="service-icon mt-4 grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl border border-sky-500/25 bg-sky-500/10 text-xl text-sky-400" aria-hidden="true">⌂</span>
                <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-bold text-white">Fondazioni e cantine</h3>
                <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">Umidità di risalita, infiltrazioni e pareti controterra: partiamo dai segnali e dal contesto dell’edificio.</p>
                <span class="card-link mt-auto pt-4 text-xs font-bold text-sky-400">Approfondisci <b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></span>
            </a>
            <a class="service-card rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900 p-7 shadow-lg shadow-black/60 transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-zinc-700 hover:bg-zinc-800/80 hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:shadow-2xl" href="/fondazioni#terrazzi">
                <span class="card-index text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-400">02 / SUPERFICI ESTERNE</span>
                <span class="service-icon mt-4 grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl border border-sky-500/25 bg-sky-500/10 text-xl text-sky-400" aria-hidden="true">▱</span>
                <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-bold text-white">Terrazzi e balconi</h3>
                <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">Una valutazione attenta di pavimentazione, giunti, scarichi e raccordi per risalire all’origine dell’acqua.</p>
                <span class="card-link mt-auto pt-4 text-xs font-bold text-sky-400">Approfondisci <b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></span>
            </a>
            <a class="service-card rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900 p-7 shadow-lg shadow-black/60 transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-zinc-700 hover:bg-zinc-800/80 hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:shadow-2xl" href="/fondazioni#coperture">
                <span class="card-index text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-400">03 / TETTI E COPERTURE</span>
                <span class="service-icon mt-4 grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl border border-sky-500/25 bg-sky-500/10 text-xl text-sky-400" aria-hidden="true">⌂</span>
                <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-bold text-white">Tetti e coperture</h3>
                <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">Verifichiamo i punti esposti agli agenti atmosferici e valutiamo un intervento coerente con la copertura.</p>
                <span class="card-link mt-auto pt-4 text-xs font-bold text-sky-400">Approfondisci <b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></span>
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="method-preview py-20 bg-zinc-950 border-y border-zinc-800">
        <div class="wrap method-preview-grid">
            <div class="method-illustration" aria-hidden="true">
                <div class="method-ring ring-a"></div><div class="method-ring ring-b"></div>
                <div class="method-core"><span>EI</span><small>ANALISI<br />E INTERVENTO</small></div>
                <span class="method-node node-a">01</span><span class="method-node node-b">02</span><span class="method-node node-c">03</span>
            </div>
            <div class="method-copy">
                <p class="eyebrow inline-block rounded-md border border-sky-500/25 bg-sky-500/10 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-400 mb-3">UN APPROCCIO CHIARO</p>
                <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight mb-4">Prima capire.<br /><span class="text-sky-400">Poi intervenire.</span></h2>
                <p class="text-base text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">Una soluzione efficace comincia dall’ascolto e dalla valutazione del contesto. Ti accompagniamo dalla prima analisi alle indicazioni per il tuo intervento.</p>
                <a class="text-link inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-sky-400 hover:text-sky-300 transition-colors" href="/metodo">Scopri le fasi del metodo <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
            </div>
            <div class="method-steps">
                <div class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900 p-4 shadow-md transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-zinc-700 hover:bg-zinc-800/80"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-sky-500/30 bg-sky-500/10 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-sky-400">01</span><div><strong class="block text-sm font-bold text-white mb-0.5">Ascolto</strong><small class="text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed block">Raccogliamo le informazioni sul problema.</small></div></div>
                <div class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900 p-4 shadow-md transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-zinc-700 hover:bg-zinc-800/80"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-sky-500/30 bg-sky-500/10 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-sky-400">02</span><div><strong class="block text-sm font-bold text-white mb-0.5">Valutazione</strong><small class="text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed block">Analizziamo la zona e le condizioni del supporto.</small></div></div>
                <div class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900 p-4 shadow-md transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-zinc-700 hover:bg-zinc-800/80"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-sky-500/30 bg-sky-500/10 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-sky-400">03</span><div><strong class="block text-sm font-bold text-white mb-0.5">Proposta</strong><small class="text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed block">Condividiamo i possibili passi successivi.</small></div></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="polyurea-section py-20 bg-black">
        <div class="wrap">
            <div class="mb-10 text-center sm:text-left">
                <p class="inline-block rounded-md border border-sky-500/25 bg-sky-500/10 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-400">MATERIALI E PRESTAZIONI</p>
                <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">I benefici concreti<br /><span class="text-sky-400">della poliurea.</span></h2>
                <p class="mt-3 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">Protezione totale, cantiere rapido e massima durata. Consulta i vantaggi diretti e apri le schede tecniche solo se desideri approfondire i parametri esecutivi.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="bento-grid grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5 sm:gap-6">
                <!-- Card 1: Hero Anchor (Tenuta continua) -->
                <article class="col-span-1 md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-2 lg:row-span-2 group relative flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900 p-7 sm:p-9 shadow-2xl transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-zinc-700 hover:bg-zinc-800/80 hover:-translate-y-1">
                    <div class="relative z-10">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-6">
                            <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-sky-500/30 bg-sky-500/10 text-sky-400 shadow-lg shadow-sky-500/10 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300">
                                <svg class="h-6 w-6" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                    <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
                                    <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/>
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <span class="rounded-md border border-sky-500/25 bg-sky-500/10 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-400">TENUTA TOTALE</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl mb-3">Impermeabilità continua senza giunzioni</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400 line-clamp-2">Elimina alla radice il rischio di infiltrazioni d'acqua con uno scudo protettivo monolitico e uniforme.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="relative z-10 mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-zinc-800/80 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                        <div class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950/80 p-3 transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-zinc-700 hover:bg-zinc-900">
                            <span class="block text-[11px] font-mono font-bold uppercase text-sky-400">Sicurezza</span>
                            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-white">Zero infiltrazioni</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950/80 p-3 transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-zinc-700 hover:bg-zinc-900">
                            <span class="block text-[11px] font-mono font-bold uppercase text-sky-400">Durabilità</span>
                            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-white">Senza rifacimenti</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <!-- Card 2: Azzeramento fermi cantiere (Wide) -->
                <article class="col-span-1 md:col-span-1 lg:col-span-2 group relative flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900 p-6 sm:p-7 shadow-xl transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-zinc-700 hover:bg-zinc-800/80 hover:-translate-y-1">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-4">
                        <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-sky-500/30 bg-sky-500/10 text-sky-400 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300">
                            <svg class="h-5 w-5" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                <polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"/>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <span class="rounded-md border border-sky-500/25 bg-sky-500/10 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-400">TEMPI RECORD</span>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Azzeramento dei fermi cantiere</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400 line-clamp-2">Superfici nuovamente fruibili in giornata per azzerare disagi e costi di blocco attività.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <!-- Card 3: Elasticità (Compact) -->
                <article class="col-span-1 md:col-span-1 lg:col-span-1 group relative flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900 p-6 sm:p-7 shadow-xl transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-zinc-700 hover:bg-zinc-800/80 hover:-translate-y-1">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-4">
                        <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-sky-500/30 bg-sky-500/10 text-sky-400 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300">
                            <svg class="h-5 w-5" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                <path d="m5 9-3 3 3 3"/>
                                <path d="m19 9 3 3-3 3"/>
                                <path d="M2 12h20"/>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <span class="rounded-md border border-sky-500/25 bg-sky-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-400">FLESSIBILITÀ</span>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2">Resistenza a crepe e assestamenti</h3>
                        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-zinc-400 line-clamp-2">Segue i movimenti dell'edificio e le dilatazioni termiche senza spaccarsi né fessurarsi.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <!-- Card 4: Adattabilità geometrica (Compact) -->
                <article class="col-span-1 md:col-span-1 lg:col-span-1 group relative flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900 p-6 sm:p-7 shadow-xl transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-zinc-700 hover:bg-zinc-800/80 hover:-translate-y-1">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-4">
                        <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-sky-500/30 bg-sky-500/10 text-sky-400 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300">
                            <svg class="h-5 w-5" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                <path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"/>
                                <polyline points="3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96"/>
                                <line x1="12" y1="22.08" x2="12" y2="12"/>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <span class="rounded-md border border-sky-500/25 bg-sky-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-400">GEOMETRIE</span>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2">Sigillatura di forme complesse</h3>
                        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-zinc-400 line-clamp-2">Avvolge scarichi, risvolti verticali e angoli difficili senza giunzioni vulnerabili.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <!-- Card 5: Resistenza UV e Ristagni (Wide) -->
                <article class="col-span-1 md:col-span-1 lg:col-span-2 group relative flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900 p-6 sm:p-7 shadow-xl transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-zinc-700 hover:bg-zinc-800/80 hover:-translate-y-1">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-4">
                        <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-sky-500/30 bg-sky-500/10 text-sky-400 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300">
                            <svg class="h-5 w-5" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                <path d="M22 12a10.06 10.06 0 0 0-20 0Z"/>
                                <path d="M12 12v8a2 2 0 0 0 4 0"/>
                                <path d="M12 2v1"/>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <span class="rounded-md border border-sky-500/25 bg-sky-500/10 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-400">DURABILITÀ</span>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Resistenza a calpestio e intemperie</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400 line-clamp-2">Non teme ristagni d'acqua prolungati, gelo o sole battente, anche su superfici trafficate.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <!-- Card 6: Ciclo e Valutazione (Wide) -->
                <article class="col-span-1 md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-2 group relative flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900 p-6 sm:p-7 shadow-xl transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-zinc-700 hover:bg-zinc-800/80 hover:-translate-y-1">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-4">
                            <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-sky-500/30 bg-sky-500/10 text-sky-400 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300">
                                <svg class="h-5 w-5" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                    <path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/>
                                    <path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"/>
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <span class="rounded-md border border-sky-500/25 bg-sky-500/10 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-400">GARANZIA</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Intervento mirato e collaudo finale</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400 line-clamp-2">Intervento pianificato su misura con sopralluogo diagnostico preliminare e tenuta garantita.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-zinc-800/60 flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span class="text-xs text-zinc-500">Valutazione preliminare mirata</span>
                        <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-sky-400 hover:text-sky-300 transition-colors" href="/metodo">
                            Approfondisci il metodo <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </article>
            </div>

            <!-- Progressive Disclosure: Menu a tendina interattivi per dettagli tecnici -->
            <div class="mt-14 rounded-3xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950/70 p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-2xl">
                <div class="mb-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-end justify-between gap-4">
                    <div>
                        <p class="inline-block rounded-md border border-sky-500/25 bg-sky-500/10 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-400 mb-2">PROGRESSIVE DISCLOSURE · DETTAGLI TECNICI</p>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white">Specifiche e parametri applicativi</h3>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400 max-w-sm leading-relaxed">Espandi i menu a tendina per visualizzare i requisiti di cantiere, le tempistiche chimiche e le certificazioni.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-4">
                    <!-- 1. Spessori e continuità -->
                    <details class="group rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900 p-5 sm:p-6 shadow-xl transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-zinc-700 hover:bg-zinc-800/60 open:border-zinc-700 open:bg-zinc-900/90">
                        <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-3 text-sm sm:text-lg font-bold text-white select-none">
                            <span class="flex items-center gap-2.5 sm:gap-3 min-w-0 flex-1">
                                <span class="flex h-7 w-7 sm:h-8 sm:w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-sky-500/30 bg-sky-500/10 text-xs font-mono font-bold text-sky-400">01</span>
                                <span class="break-words">Spessori nominali e continuità della membrana</span>
                            </span>
                            <span class="ml-2 sm:ml-4 flex h-7 w-7 sm:h-8 sm:w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-zinc-700 bg-zinc-950 text-sky-400 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180">
                                <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg>
                            </span>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-zinc-800 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                            <div>
                                <strong class="block text-white font-semibold mb-1">Applicazione ad alta pressione (170–200 bar)</strong>
                                <p>La poliurea pura viene nebulizzata a caldo (65–75°C) con unità bimixer idrauliche ad alta pressione. Raggiunge uno spessore nominale continuo compreso tra 2.0 e 2.5 mm in un'unica passata senza rischi di colature o imperfezioni.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <strong class="block text-white font-semibold mb-1">Assenza totale di sormonti e saldature</strong>
                                <p>Elimina completamente i teli prefabbricati e le saldature a fiamma o ad aria calda. La membrana aderisce chimicamente al supporto formando una pellicola monolitica continua priva di giunti vulnerabili.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </details>

                    <!-- 2. Tempi di polimerizzazione -->
                    <details class="group rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900 p-5 sm:p-6 shadow-xl transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-zinc-700 hover:bg-zinc-800/60 open:border-zinc-700 open:bg-zinc-900/90">
                        <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-3 text-sm sm:text-lg font-bold text-white select-none">
                            <span class="flex items-center gap-2.5 sm:gap-3 min-w-0 flex-1">
                                <span class="flex h-7 w-7 sm:h-8 sm:w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-sky-500/30 bg-sky-500/10 text-xs font-mono font-bold text-sky-400">02</span>
                                <span class="break-words">Tempi di reazione, polimerizzazione e calpestabilità</span>
                            </span>
                            <span class="ml-2 sm:ml-4 flex h-7 w-7 sm:h-8 sm:w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-zinc-700 bg-zinc-950 text-sky-400 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180">
                                <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg>
                            </span>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-zinc-800 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                            <div>
                                <strong class="block text-white font-semibold mb-1">Reazione chimica in pochi secondi</strong>
                                <p>Il tempo di gel ("gel time") è immediato, compreso tra 5 e 15 secondi dall'uscita dall'ugello. La superficie risulta fuori impronta ("tack-free") entro appena 30 secondi dall'applicazione.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <strong class="block text-white font-semibold mb-1">Riapertura in 60 minuti e collaudo a 24 ore</strong>
                                <p>La superficie è pedonabile già dopo 1 ora dall'intervento. La piena maturazione meccanico-chimica con prova di allagamento o collaudo idraulico viene completata entro 24 ore a 20°C.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </details>

                    <!-- 3. Preparazione del supporto -->
                    <details class="group rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900 p-5 sm:p-6 shadow-xl transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-zinc-700 hover:bg-zinc-800/60 open:border-zinc-700 open:bg-zinc-900/90">
                        <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-3 text-sm sm:text-lg font-bold text-white select-none">
                            <span class="flex items-center gap-2.5 sm:gap-3 min-w-0 flex-1">
                                <span class="flex h-7 w-7 sm:h-8 sm:w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-sky-500/30 bg-sky-500/10 text-xs font-mono font-bold text-sky-400">03</span>
                                <span class="break-words">Preparazione del supporto, primer e controllo dell’umidità</span>
                            </span>
                            <span class="ml-2 sm:ml-4 flex h-7 w-7 sm:h-8 sm:w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-zinc-700 bg-zinc-950 text-sky-400 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180">
                                <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg>
                            </span>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-zinc-800 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                            <div>
                                <strong class="block text-white font-semibold mb-1">Trattamento meccanico del sottofondo</strong>
                                <p>L'aderenza ottimale richiede l'apertura della porosità del calcestruzzo mediante levigatura con mole diamantate, pallinatura o fresatura, seguita da aspirazione industriale delle polveri e risanamento dei giunti.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <strong class="block text-white font-semibold mb-1">Verifica umidità (&lt; 4%) e primer epossidico</strong>
                                <p>Si verifica l'umidità residua con igrometro a carburo. Si applica quindi un primer epossidico bicomponente con spolvero di quarzo a saturazione per garantire una forza di adesione al supporto superiore a 2.5 MPa.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </details>

                    <!-- 4. Crack-bridging ed elasticità -->
                    <details class="group rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900 p-5 sm:p-6 shadow-xl transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-zinc-700 hover:bg-zinc-800/60 open:border-zinc-700 open:bg-zinc-900/90">
                        <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-3 text-sm sm:text-lg font-bold text-white select-none">
                            <span class="flex items-center gap-2.5 sm:gap-3 min-w-0 flex-1">
                                <span class="flex h-7 w-7 sm:h-8 sm:w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-sky-500/30 bg-sky-500/10 text-xs font-mono font-bold text-sky-400">04</span>
                                <span class="break-words">Crack-bridging, allungamento elastico e finiture UV</span>
                            </span>
                            <span class="ml-2 sm:ml-4 flex h-7 w-7 sm:h-8 sm:w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-zinc-700 bg-zinc-950 text-sky-400 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180">
                                <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg>
                            </span>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-zinc-800 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                            <div>
                                <strong class="block text-white font-semibold mb-1">Allungamento a rottura superiore al 400%</strong>
                                <p>La capacità di crack-bridging dinamico di classe B 4.2 (-20°C) consente alla membrana di assorbire microlesioni e dilatazioni strutturali del supporto senza subire stiramenti permanenti o rotture.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <strong class="block text-white font-semibold mb-1">Protezione alifatica dai raggi UV</strong>
                                <p>Per coperture e terrazzi a vista viene applicato un topcoat poliuretanico alifatico elastico bicomponente, che garantisce stabilità del colore e resistenza all'invecchiamento fotochimico nel tempo.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </details>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

